一發言人。原句未書憺，保留上下文判讀。","references":[{"title":"《南史》卷52正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B752&oldid=1749412","source_revision":1749412,"source_position":{"first_line":124,"last_line":124},"quote":"始興忠武王憺字僧達，文帝第十一子也。","wikitext_sha256":"3d6128e6c22dfb6f6a8de1bed97c7a37255fa1b41820a5a617c0340ade24939f","image_verified":false},{"title":"《南史》卷52正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B752&oldid=1749412","source_revision":1749412,"source_position":{"first_line":126,"last_line":126},"quote":"天監元年，加安西將軍，封始興郡王。","wikitext_sha256":"3d6128e6c22dfb6f6a8de1bed97c7a37255fa1b41820a5a617c0340ade24939f","image_verified":false}],"human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004","text":"天監元年以本官領前軍將軍其年遷冠軍將軍丹陽尹為政清靜去煩苛京師有寡婦無子姑亡舉債以斂葬既葬而無以還之志愍其義以俸錢償焉時年饑每旦為粥於郡門以賦百姓民稱之不容口三年為散騎常侍中書令領游擊將軍志為中書令及居京尹便懷止足常謂諸子姪曰謝莊在宋孝武世位止中書令吾自視豈可以過之因多謝病簡通賓客遷前將軍太常卿六年出為雲麾將軍安西始興王長史南郡太守明年遷軍師將軍平西鄱陽郡王長史江夏太守並加秩中二千石九年遷為散騎常侍金紫光祿大夫十二年卒時年五十四","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":32,"end":34,"surface":"寡婦","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004:u0032","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"丹陽寡婦"},{"start":36,"end":37,"surface":"姑","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004:u0036","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"寡婦之夫母"},{"start":50,"end":51,"surface":"志","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004:m0050","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作志。"},{"start":71,"end":73,"surface":"百姓","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004:u0071","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"受賑濟者"},{"start":73,"end":74,"surface":"民","id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhi-wyd:p004:u0073","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_no