_lcf_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本卷語句、名號及敘述時代辨讀。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":86,"last_line":86,"revision_id":1513347,"source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"raw_start":7844,"raw_end":7862,"raw_character_offsets":[7844,7845,7846,7847,7848,7849,7850,7851,7852,7853,7854,7855,7856,7857,7858,7859,7860,7861],"projection_sha256":"163b1c3559e4d1173d80db58a82dd433fc96a2a47cb93e79dda30a61558fcf73"},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-wangzhi-royal-context","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-wangzhi-royal-context-ws1513347"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067","text":"子琮爲國子生，尚始興王女繁昌主。琮不慧，爲學生所嗤，遂離婚。峻謝王，王曰：「此自上意，僕極不願如此。」峻曰：「下官曾祖是謝仁祖外孫，亦不藉殿下姻媾爲門戸耳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"琮","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"始興王","kind":"person","person_id":"fjm_eo3_0zz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"繁昌主","kind":"person","person_id":"fjm_eo3_0zz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"琮","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"峻","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"fjm_eo3_0zz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line067:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"fjm_eo3_0zz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"